{"type":"research","references":[{"note":"Host Haru-san is a 75-year-old small, slightly plump man with kind eyes, smile lines, short silver hair in a neat low bun, round tortoiseshell glasses, wearing a mustard-yellow knit cardigan over a white blouse, a navy apron, a beige long skirt, and brown slip-on shoes.","url":"https://deeptokyo.jp/en/food_gourmet/1588","title":"Experiencing the Charm of Traditional Japanese Kissaten and the Showa Era｜DEEPTOKYOmagazine","use":"costume"},{"note":"The kissaten interior features a wooden counter, siphon coffee maker, teapots, old tube radio, round wall clock, potted plants, and a large window with warm afternoon light; main color #efe2c6 and accent #b0773a.","url":"https://deeptokyo.jp/en/food_gourmet/1588","title":"Experiencing the Charm of Traditional Japanese Kissaten and the Showa Era｜DEEPTOKYOmagazine","use":"set"},{"note":"Palette includes warm amber, cream, and muted sage tones: #efe2c6 (main), #b0773a (accent), #d9a63a (cardigan), #8fa58a (sage), #2f3d5c (apron accent).","url":"https://deeptokyo.jp/en/food_gourmet/1588","title":"Experiencing the Charm of Traditional Japanese Kissaten and the Showa Era｜DEEPTOKYOmagazine","use":"palette"},{"note":"A 1950s-style envelope on the counter is faded and contains a letter the old gentleman never delivered to someone he loved fifty years ago.","url":"https://hatsukoi.co.uk/blog/155-what-is-the-showa-retro-aesthetic-a-practical-guide.html","title":"What is the Showa Retro aesthetic? A practical guide","use":"props"},{"note":"The old gentleman reads the letter aloud, ends with a small smile, and says “やっと、言えた気がします” (“It finally feels like I said it”).","url":"https://hatsukoi.co.uk/blog/155-what-is-the-showa-retro-aesthetic-a-practical-guide.html","title":"What is the Showa Retro aesthetic? A practical guide","use":"customs"},{"note":"Evening scene on a riverbank lined with full-bloom cherry trees; petals fall onto the envelope as the elderly man walks home.","url":"https://hatsukoi.co.uk/blog/155-what-is-the-showa-retro-aesthetic-a-practical-guide.html","title":"What is the Showa Retro aesthetic? A practical guide","use":"set"}]}
